# Kotlin sources are LF in the repository and in every working copy: the source-text guard tests read them and
# compare multi-line snippets written with LF (2026-10-01: half the working copies were CRLF via core.autocrlf, ROOT_CAUSES #119).
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
tools/remote/*.sh text eol=lf
tools/remote/*.gradle text eol=lf
# Source snapshots must retain the bytes whose SHA-256 is in the CLUE manifest.
docs/CLUE/sources/*.wiki -text -diff
